<title>UK: Beazer Homes to change name to Beazer Group.</title>
<headline>Beazer Homes to change name to Beazer Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK housebuilder Beazer Homes Plc is to change its name to Beazer Group Plc with effect from November 14, it said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The name change proposal was approved by shareholders at the annual general meeting earlier.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
